<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav June crude output unchanged versus May.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav June crude output unchanged versus May.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following crude and natural gas output details.</p>
<p>					    June 96     May 96	June 95</p>
<p> Crude oil (tonnes)		    86,000     86,000	 89,000</p>
<p> Natural gas (million cubic meters)  52	   54	     45</p>
<p>-- Amra Kevic, Belgrade newsroom +381 11 2224305</p>
</text>
